# The build context is the repository root (Dockerfile): only VERSION, the
# protocol and server projects, the documents the server embeds
# and the daemon binaries go in.
*
!VERSION
!docs/
!protocol/
!server/
!daemon-dist/
!dist/

# Build output, dependencies and local files are rebuilt in the image.
**/_build
**/deps
**/node_modules
**/.elixir_ls
**/.lexical
**/cover
**/erl_crash.dump
**/priv/plts
**/tmp
protocol/test
server/test
server/priv/static/assets
server/priv/static/cache_manifest.json
server/priv/static/**/*.gz
server/priv/static/**/*-????????????????????????????????.*
